<description>&lt;p&gt;The junta continues destructive operations, destroying bridges in Arakan, advancing west of the Sittaung River and planning a 108‑kilometre fence along the Bangladesh border while conducting airstrikes that killed civilians, including a strike on a displacement camp in Rakhine state. In Sagaing, junta forces killed 11 people as Starlink outages isolated communities, and health-care facilities faced attacks throughout October 2026. ASEAN has offered a conditional path for sidelined Myanmar leaders to return to summits, tying any participation to measurable progress on its peace plan, while pursuing a coherent engagement strategy. The conflict caused 2,332 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dw.com/en/asean-offers-myanmar-s-sidelined-leaders-a-path-back-to-summits-but-says-restrictions-will-stay-until-there-is-meaningful-progress-on-its-peace-plan/a-79951878?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-rdf&quot;&gt;Deutsche Welle&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/nov/15/myanmar-rohingya-genocide-icj&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiwFBVV95cUxOTnpzYzQzYjdfaUJPWHctemRJbWpSb1pRZHRtbFZjWTVXN05fNmxMQWRINDBpTHJqRW41STVZSlJ1R19iYXFZbEprOFBrRDV1Uk5RemtGN3VPb0Z0dFd4NnJGcDdxcGc4NjFBRTBNc1NjcWx0blJQZ090OUR3bGhYekZjRHVNU0xKWF9R?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihgFBVV95cUxQa243LUNpZk83XzNYOHBGaUhxYWpvcE1ETkJkbEFMc3d5UWdpdzZSUkxhMHFhNk1uejRlbEZUZ1JKZmVmMXc4cmR6dWgxenhwLXh2c243eWt5TktjUm1XbzVVSG9Wb2FFWE1sRTJTZFZwcWNtWW5iSERmMkJrQWVIOVUwS25pQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Myanmar International TV&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&q